From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Charlie <5764343+charlielye@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:03:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(simulator): reach bb-avm-sim's world state and
 contract DB through hostCall

The pool binds the AVM's wsdb and cdb host-call targets for a process
as it does in-process: the WSDB server by its socket path, and the CDB
dispatch, which ipc-runtime serves to the process over a socket of its
own. CdbIpcServer no longer opens a socket. The world state sends Init
when it creates the aztec-wsdb process (WsdbService.process({ init })).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015HXzMEGRnmFYs5yXRcAWCb

